Description: innovative Not-Desktop environment built with Flutter and Rust
 Veshell is a Wayland/drm compositor paired with a Flutter shell. It provides
 a predictable, spatially organized workflow and reduces the need to manage
 windows manually.
 .
 This package carries the compositor, the AOT-compiled Dart shell, the
 matching Flutter embedder engine and the session, portal and systemd user
 units. It depends on distribution-managed fonts and runtime services.
